@;@ RHP_name: A Random Hobbit (02/07/99)
@;@ For: The L.O.R.D. Cavern v1.3c+
@;@ Written_by: Michael Everett
@;@@PROGRAM@ LORDCAVE
@;@@VERSION@ 1.3c

`@A small Hobbit jumps from behind a rock!

`@Try and talk to the Hobbit?`l
@YESNO@
@##N

`%You decide it best to kill the little pest.
@EXPERIENCE@ %+1
@END@
@##Y

`@What would you like to talk to the Hobbit about?
  `9(`@E`9)`@xperience
  `9(`@C`9)`@harm
  `9(`@H`9)`@it Points
@PROMPT@ ECH
@##E
@RANDOM@ 3
@##1
@CLEAR@

`%I'm too tired to talk right now, maybe another time.
@END@
@##2
@CLEAR@

`%Yes my son, I know much about experience...

`%You absorb The Hobbit's every word.
@EXPERIENCE@ +1
@END@
@##3
@CLEAR@

`%There is nothing I could teach you on this subject,
`%I am sorry my friend.
@END@
@##C
@RANDOM@ 3
@##1
@CLEAR@

`%I'm too tired to talk right now, maybe another time.
@END@
@##2
@CLEAR@

`%I love this subject and you look
`%as though you need my advice.

`%You listen carefully to The Hobbit.
@CHARM@ 3
@END@
@##3
@CLEAR@

`%There is nothing I could teach you on this subject,
`%I am sorry my friend.
@END@
@##H
@RANDOM@ 3
@##1
@CLEAR@

`%I'm too tired to talk right now, maybe another time.
@END@
@##2
@CLEAR@

`%The Hobbit tells you how to
`%fight longer while in battle.
@HITPOINTS@ 4*LEVEL

@END@
@##3
@CLEAR@

`%There is nothing I could teach you on this subject,
`%I am sorry my friend.
@END@

